Q: System.FormatException: Input string was not in a correct format. MVC5 A: <p>This is because you're trying to parse a string that cannot be converted to an integer. Use <code>int.TryParse()</code> method</p>

<pre><code> int myInt;
 var result = int.TryParse("23", out myInt);

 if (result == true)
 {
    // do something...
 }
</code></pre>

